      "summonRole": "Flame Spider",
      "biography": "<p><em>Fire Release: Crimson Spider (D-Rank) (Fire Release Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 10 + 2 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 18 + 8 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft..</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +2 (save +2), DEX +3 (save +3), CON +1 (save +0), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Fire, Psychic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
